{"version":1,"content":"<p>Telegram創始人兼CEO帕維爾·杜羅夫近日在社交媒體上發推，吐槽了《GTA6》。杜羅夫認為，《GTA6》中最不真實的地方在於，遊戲主角能夠經營犯罪活動，卻連一個Telegram羣都沒有。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1587678.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T13:55:15.877856+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T13:36:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T13:48:37.744379+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T13:48:37.744379+00:00","content_hash":"9561c3ad9f3331acb7f41c8809208d20857f2bdad7725f4dd7ca254c4963851e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}